\title{tm.hyslaw: Teal Modules for Hy's Law Monitoring and eDISH Plots}
\description{
Provides an open-source teal module and reusable builders for exploratory Hy's Law monitoring from CDISC ADaM-style ADSL and ADLB. Peak eDISH, mDISH, and cholestatic screening plots plus concurrent ALT/AST plus bilirubin elevations (optional ALP exclusion) are classified without depending on study-specific ADDILI datasets. Table and plot builders can be called without launching Shiny.
